id: variable-unarmed-mark
name: Variable: Unarmed
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Variable Fighter (2)'s, till the start of your next turn - read as the Wound is (chat.mjs variableParts).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Variable Fighter: the Wound Rolls of your Unarmed Attacks 1(T) higher until the start of your next turn.
text: >
  Variable Fighter (2): If you hit an Opponent with an Unarmed Attack or an Armed Attack, increase the Wound Rolls of the other by
  1(T) until the start of your next turn.

---

[passive]
